%% title: SCT Inst Payment Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : submit() — sanctions REVIEW or screening unavailable
    [*] --> PROCESSING : submit() — CLEAR, scheme accepted (ACSC)
    [*] --> REJECTED : submit() — BLOCK (sanctions hit) or scheme RJCT
    PENDING --> PROCESSING : manual release after AML review
    PROCESSING --> SETTLED : settlement booked
    PROCESSING --> TIMEOUT : execution_timeout_at exceeded
    SETTLED --> RECALLED : recall(reason)
    REJECTED --> [*]
    TIMEOUT --> [*]
    RECALLED --> [*]
    SETTLED --> [*]
